      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems I have encounted same issue.\n- Expression menu can't use.\n- My avatar never shows in mirror or camera.\n- From friends view, avatar is showing but its behavior is like desktop mode.\nhttps://twitter.com/4risaka/status/1334679953938399233\n(sorry, this tweet written in Japanese)\nConditions of reproduce this issue is following settings in my environment.\n- SDK: VRCSDK3-AVATAR-2020.11.16.12.43_Public\n- VRChat Ver.: w_2020.4.3(12/4/2020 updated)\n * This issue never occurs when I played at 12/3/2020 in previous VRChat version.\n- Avatar performance: VeryPoor or Poor or Medium\n- DynamicBone: any(This issue occurs even if DB is omitted)\n- FX / Gesture / Expression Menu: any(This issue occurs even if these setting is omitted)\n* Some projects with the same settings as above will not cause problems.Therefore, the correct occurrence conditions have not been identified.",
